# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Source artwork, kept out of version control
#
# These are the originals the optimised, shipped assets were produced
# from — 44 MB of them against 2.6 MB actually referenced by the site.
# Git keeps every byte forever, so committing them would make the repo
# permanently ~20x larger than the site it builds.
#
# Nothing here is deleted from disk; this only keeps it out of history.
# If you want an original back in the repo, remove its line below.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------

# Originals superseded by the webp/jpg the site loads
/public/images/*.png
/public/images/*.svg

# Earlier hero plates, replaced by the matched pair in /public/images/hero/
/public/images/hero-port.webp
/public/images/hero-ship.webp
/public/images/hero-sky.jpg
/public/images/hero-water.jpg

# Raw 10s clip; /public/video/hero-loader.mp4 is the 3.5s cut that ships
/public/hero-video.mp4

# Stray exports
/public/images/full*
/public/images/a_wide_*

# Diagnostic render from the logo-treatment comparison
/logo-compare.png
